 r←server OnServerTimeout msg;⎕TRAP;fn
⍝ ⍺ ←→ a Server space. Changed according to my needs: Kai2#
⍝ ⎕TRAP must be localized for "C" (cut back) to work
 r←0
 :If 0<⎕NC'#.ErrorParms.signal'
     ⎕TRAP←⊂#.ErrorParms.signal'C' '→∆CarryOn'
 :EndIf
 {}CloseIdleConnections server
 {}CheckUpstreamHealth server
 :If server.OnCongaTimeout≢''
     fn←server.Context⍎server.OnCongaTimeout
     {}fn server
 :EndIf
 :Return

∆CarryOn:
 server ErrorInRumba ⍬
⍝Done
